{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"mingdi-e-o040a","title":"曹叡乘龙舟东征张颖拒守新城吴军退","accounts":[{"id":"mingdi-e-o040a-account","label":"《明帝纪》正文","text":"曹叡乘龙舟东征张颖拒守新城吴军退","evidence":["mingdi-e-o040a-q"]}],"participants":[{"person":"wendi-p0005","role":"东征","evidence":["mingdi-e-o040a-q"]},{"person":"mingdi-p0039","role":"拒守","evidence":["mingdi-e-o040a-q"]},{"person":"sun-quan","role":"退兵","evidence":["mingdi-e-o040a-q"]},{"person":"xianzhu-p0115","role":"退兵","evidence":["mingdi-e-o040a-q"]},{"person":"mingdi-p0037","role":"退兵","evidence":["mingdi-e-o040a-q"]}],"place":{"text":"新城","evidence":["mingdi-e-o040a-q"]},"time":{"year":234,"label":"秋七月壬寅出征","precision":"year","basis":"逐条核对本篇纪年及所引释年；未换算公历日。","chronology":"mingdi-y234","dating_review":{"reviewed":true,"anchor":"mingdi-q-o037","basis":"秋七月壬寅出征"},"evidence":["mingdi-e-o040a-q","mingdi-q-o037","mingdi-q-b-7a11c761ca65aeb3d195"]},"ordering_evidence":"mingdi-e-o040a-q","source_order":[3,270,"O040a"],"order":862}],"persons":[{"id":"mingdi-p0037","name":"孙韶","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"mingdi-p0039","name":"张颖","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"sun-quan","name":"孙权","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"wendi-p0005","name":"曹叡","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"xianzhu-p0115","name":"陆逊","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"mingdi-e-o040a-q","section":"chapter-003","block":"b-86852a0ccf13743ef54c","layer":"original","quote":"秋七月，壬寅〖11〗，帝亲御龙舟，东征。权攻新城，将军张颖等拒守力战。帝军未至数百里，权遁走，议、韶等亦退。群臣以为：“大将军方与诸葛亮相持，未解，车驾可西幸长安。”帝曰：“权走，亮胆破；大将军（以）〔必〕制之！吾无忧矣。”遂进军幸寿春，录诸将功，封赏各有差。八月，己未〖12〗，大曜兵〖13〗，飨六军；遣使者持节，犒劳合肥、寿春诸军。辛巳〖14〗，行还许昌宫。","section_title":"明帝纪第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0011.xhtml","index":269,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":181},{"id":"mingdi-q-b-7a11c761ca65aeb3d195","section":"chapter-003","block":"b-7a11c761ca65aeb3d195","layer":"modern","quote":"〖1〗二年：青龙二年（公元 234）。己未：旧历初四日。","section_title":"明帝纪第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0011.xhtml","index":252,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-6c0753fe684a18a3a281","start":0,"end":28},{"id":"mingdi-q-o037","section":"chapter-003","block":"b-ff97c2d326d0fc08a9de","layer":"original","quote":"二年春二月，（乙）〔己〕未〖1〗，太白犯荧惑。癸酉〖2〗，诏曰：“‘鞭作官刑〖3〗’，所以纠慢怠也〖4〗；而顷多以无辜死。其减鞭杖之制〖5〗，著于令。”三月，庚寅〖6〗，山阳公薨；帝素服发哀〖7〗，遣使持节，典护丧事。己酉〖8〗，大赦。","section_title":"明帝纪第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0011.xhtml","index":249,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":118}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
